00:00:59.170 --> 00:01:01.140
- He directed the cover up.

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:05.310
And in fact, everybody else was paid off.

00:01:05.310 --> 00:01:06.750
- I just want to look at the facts.

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:09.610
And so far very few facts
have been presented.

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:11.680
When you repeat this
phrase, I feel like a lot,

00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:14.290
