00:02:02.610 --> 00:02:04.890
at the expense of
millions of people dying?

00:02:04.890 --> 00:02:08.320
So I looked into it, and
I stumbled upon an article

00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:09.600
in the British Medical Journal,

00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:12.867
which is a highly, highly
respected medical journal.

00:02:12.867 --> 00:02:15.457
"The press agency reported
