everything you're saying

00:07:18.230 --> 00:07:20.890
is just your thoughts.

00:07:20.890 --> 00:07:22.600
And while your thoughts are great,

00:07:22.600 --> 00:07:24.130
they mean nothing without facts.

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:28.240
- If we activate mandatory
vaccines globally,

00:07:28.240 --> 00:07:29.570
I imagine these people stand to make

00:07:29.570 --> 00:07:30.750
hundreds of billions of dollars.

00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:32.958
- I'm not sure who he
means, "these people"

00:07:32.958 --> 00:07:33.810
that are going to stand to make

00:07:33.810 --> 00:07:35.110
hundreds of billions of dollars.

00:07:35.110 --> 00:07:37.610
First of all, if the Bill Gates Foundation

00:07:37.610 --> 00:07:39.810
actually finds the coronavirus vaccine,

00:07:39.810 --> 00:07:40.980
and it's the one that's used,

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:42.777
they already said they're
not going to patent it,

00:07:42.777 --> 00:07:43.780
they're going to make it free.

00:07:43.780 --> 00:07:45.530
So that's already untrue there.

00:07:45.530 --> 00:07:47.850
It's also important at
