00:18:40.420 --> 00:18:43.250
She's taking things that
are happening simultaneously

00:18:43.250 --> 00:18:45.840
and connecting them
without any kind of proof

00:18:45.840 --> 00:18:46.910
of this causation.

00:18:46.910 --> 00:18:49.350
Experts are allowed to have theories

00:18:49.350 --> 00:18:51.970
and a lot of these theories
will be proven to be incorrect.

00:18:51.970 --> 00:18:54.100
That's part of the scientific process.

00:18:54.100 --> 00:18:57.290
But you have to approach
this with a level of humility

00:18:57.290 --> 00:18:59.600
by knowing that anytime
you're putting out a theory

00:18:59.600 --> 00:19:00.670
it could be wrong.

00:19:00.670 --> 00:19:03.120
And I don't feel like
she's doing that here

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:07.440
by acting as if what she's
saying is 100% accurate,

00:19:07.440 --> 00:19:09.270
